  },
  {
    "timestamp": "2026-04-08T23:59:23.374371",
    "event_type": "historical_post",
    "content": {
      "post_content": "A company rejected me for a Senior Data Analyst role.\n\n\nThe next day, they hired me as a Data Analyst.\nFor a long time, I thought interviews were about knowledge.\n\nThey\u2019re not. They\u2019re about risk.\n\nThis issue is about the moment I stopped preparing \u201cseriously\u201d and started preparing strategically, and how that changed everything that followed.\n\nIf you\u2019re navigating early or mid-career transitions, this one might resonate.\n\nIssue #4 is out.\n\u2026more",
      "hashtags": [],
      "length": 448,
      "engagement": {
        "likes": "0",
