      "post_content": "Amazing opportunity at Nexifi. \n\nIf you\u2019re looking for a place to learn and be challenged, don\u2019t miss this role with Kovid Rathee. He\u2019s the kind of leader who invests in his team and pushes you to do your best work.\n\u2026more",
