  {
    "timestamp": "2026-04-08T23:59:23.523288",
    "event_type": "historical_post",
    "content": {
      "post_content": "\u201cStop Doing This on Fridays\u201d\n\n\nIf you want a productive career, stop ending Fridays in chaos.\n\nMost people end the week by escaping their tasks.\nTop performers end it by setting traps for their future success.\n\nTry this:\n \u2022 Write Monday\u2019s first task on a sticky note\n \u2022 Make it ridiculously easy\n \u2022 Leave it on your keyboard\n\nYou\u2019ll start next week with a win before coffee.\n\nMomentum > motivation.\n\n\n\nhashtag\n#careeradvice \nhashtag\n#productivity \nhashtag\n#worksmart\n\u2026more",
