      "post_content": "\ud83d\udca1 Google\u2019s \u201cPrompt to Prototype\u201d - A New Way to Learn AI, Fast\n\nEveryone wants to build with AI, but most don\u2019t know where to start.\n\nGoogle just launched a new program : \u201cStartup School: Prompt to Prototype\u201d - a free, 2-week AI skilling program (Nov 27\u2013Dec 7, 2025) for early-stage founders and builders.\n\n. . . .\n\nWhat makes it interesting isn\u2019t just that it\u2019s free. It\u2019s how they\u2019re teaching AI:\n \u2022 Learn to build prototypes using Gemini, NotebookLM, and Imagen\n \u2022 Go from prompting \u2192 to building real working AI tools\n \u2022 Get mentored directly by experts from Google\n\nEven if you\u2019re not a founder yet, this is a peek into how \u201cAI-first\u201d thinking is reshaping product development.\nPrototyping is no longer a coding exercise, it\u2019s a prompt engineering mindset.\n\n. . . .\n\n\ud83d\udcac If you\u2019ve been waiting to upskill in AI \u2014 this is one to bookmark.\n\ud83d\udc49 Link to register & full details in the comments.\n\n\nhashtag\n#AI \nhashtag\n#Google \nhashtag\n#StartupSchool \nhashtag\n#AIUpskilling \nhashtag\n#PromptEngineering \nhashtag\n#Productivity\n\u2026more",
