  {
    "timestamp": "2026-04-08T23:59:23.645505",
    "event_type": "historical_post",
    "content": {
      "post_content": "Building an AI Agent That Thinks Like Your Customer \ud83e\udde0\n\nMost companies say they want to be \u201ccustomer-obsessed.\u201d\nBut how do you operationalize that mindset - especially when your customers generate millions of interactions every day?\n\nThis is where Customer Intelligence AI Agents come in.\nBy combining OpenSearch for data retrieval and LLMs for reasoning, you can build agents that:\n\u2022 Listen to customer signals across multiple touchpoints\n\u2022 Summarize patterns in real time\n\u2022 Suggest product or service improvements before customers even ask\n\nThe exciting part?\nThis isn\u2019t just theory\u2014it\u2019s a working prototype I built using OpenSearch + LLMs.\n\nInstead of static dashboards, you get an AI co-pilot that thinks like your customer, at scale.\n\n\ud83d\udccc I shared the full walkthrough (with architecture + code) in my latest article \u2014 link in comments.\n\u2026more",
      "hashtags": [],
      "length": 846,
      "engagement": {
        "likes": "2",
        "comments": "2",
        "shares": "0"
      },
