  {
    "timestamp": "2026-04-08T23:59:23.787791",
    "event_type": "historical_post",
    "content": {
      "post_content": "\"AI tools are powerful, but are they really proactive?\" \ud83e\udd14 \n\u26a1 Most of the generative AI apps we use today, like ChatGPT and Claude, are still reactive - they respond to prompts but can't manage complex, multi-step goals autonomously.\n\n\ud83d\udd25 In my latest blog, I dive into Agentic Frameworks and why they're key to unlocking AI's full potential. Imagine an AI that doesn't just answer questions but also keeps track of your goals, adapts to changing needs, and handles workflows proactively.\n\nCheck out the post to learn how this could be the next big leap in AI-driven productivity\n\n\nhashtag\n#artificialintelligence \nhashtag\n#machinelearning \nhashtag\n#softwaredevelopment \nhashtag\n#generativeAi \nhashtag\n#langchain\n\u2026more",
