    "timestamp": "2026-04-08T23:59:23.877166",
    "event_type": "historical_post",
    "content": {
      "post_content": "OMG \u2013 you have to see this! Imagine if someone did this to your children or someone you love. This is hands down the best AI security/privacy awareness video I\u2019ve ever seen\u2026\n\nUndoubtedly, AI holds immense potential. However, it also presents substantial risks that are often overlooked. We\u2019re significantly behind in establishing clear AI regulations. And the much-debated AI Act? Let\u2019s just say, don\u2019t hold your breath for it to materialize in the next 5 years!\n\nTake a moment to watch this video, it\u2019s a real eye-opener on the importance of AI safety and the ethical implications we must consider!\n\n\nhashtag\n#ThePowerOfAI \nhashtag\n#Privacy \nhashtag\n#Cybersecurity\n\u2026more",
