    "event_type": "historical_post",
    "content": {
      "post_content": "Hiring Alert at \nhashtag\n#amazon!!\nI am providing referrals for SDE-1 and SDE-2 roles so you can DM me your CVs. Not all applicants will be referred. Basic CV selection criterias:\n\n1. SDE-1 -> 1+ years of experience (non-internship) and display of DA competency (important for hiring process but not just that).\n\n2. SDE-2 -> 3+ years of experience (non-internship) and display of DA competency (important for hiring process but not just that).\n\nThose of you who have appeared for Amazon hiring in the past 6 months in any form please wait for 6 months to make the process easier for you.\n\n\nhashtag\n#sde \nhashtag\n#sde2 \nhashtag\n#sde1 \nhashtag\n#sdejobs \nhashtag\n#amazonindia \n\nhashtag\n#hiring \nhashtag\n#job\n\u2026more",
